<title>ITALY: Italy April producer prices rise 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy April producer prices rise 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian producer price data for April.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	   April 97   March 97     April 96</p>
<p>    Year/year change	+0.8 pct    +0.9 pct     +2.6 pct</p>
<p>    Month/month change     0.0 pct    +0.3 pct     +0.1 pct</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995=100)    102.9     102.9	  124.6</p>
<p>Istat gave the following general breakdown:</p>
<p>				  Mo/Mo change (%)    Yr/Yr change (%)</p>
<p>    Consumer goods		  0.0		  +0.5</p>
<p>    Investment goods	     +0.2		  +1.9</p>
<p>    Intermediate goods	   +0.1		  +0.9</p>
<p>It gave the following sector-by-sector breakdown:</p>
<p>    Sector			    mo/mo (%)	  yr/yr (%)</p>
<p>    Minerals			 -3.2		   +8.1</p>
<p>    Non-metal minerals	   +0.7		   +3.8</p>
<p>    Chemicals			+0.9		   +0.8</p>
<p>    Metal works		    +0.4		   -0.8</p>
<p>    Cars and parts		 -0.1		   +0.9</p>
<p>    Food, drink and tobacco    +0.1		   -0.8</p>
<p>    Clothing and textiles	+0.1		   +0.3</p>
<p>    Leather goods		  +0.5		   +2.5</p>
<p>    Energy products		-0.6		   +5.8</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
